sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Calon as Calon Mahasiswa
    participant API as FastAPI PMB Router
    participant Service as PMBService
    participant Pay as PaymentGateway
    participant DB as SQLite Database
    participant Notif as NotificationService

    Calon->>API: POST /api/pmb/register (data diri & prodi)
    API->>Service: register_calon(payload)
    Service->>DB: Cek duplikasi NIK / email
    alt NIK atau Email sudah terdaftar
        DB-->>Service: Data ditemukan
        Service-->>API: Raise DuplicateRegistrationError (409)
        API-->>Calon: 409 Conflict (Pendaftaran ditolak)
    else Data unik & valid
        Service->>DB: INSERT calon_mahasiswa (status='PENDING')
        DB-->>Service: calon_id & nomor_registrasi
        Service-->>API: RegistrationResponse
        API-->>Calon: 201 Created (Nomor Registrasi)
    end

    Calon->>API: POST /api/pmb/{id}/pay (bukti pembayaran)
    API->>Pay: verifikasi_pembayaran(nomor_registrasi)
    alt Pembayaran belum lunas / tidak valid
        Pay-->>API: Status FAILED
        API-->>Calon: 402 Payment Required
    else Pembayaran terverifikasi LUNAS
        Pay-->>API: Status PAID
        API->>Service: approve_calon(calon_id)
        Service->>DB: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE (sequence NIM prodi)
        Service->>Service: generate_nim(tahun, kode_prodi, urut)
        Service->>DB: UPDATE status='APPROVED' & INSERT mahasiswa (NIM)
        Service->>DB: COMMIT TRANSACTION
        Service->>Notif: kirim_notifikasi_kelulusan(email, NIM)
        Notif-->>Calon: Email/Push info NIM aktif
        Service-->>API: ApprovalResponse (NIM)
        API-->>Calon: 200 OK (Selamat, NIM diterbitkan)
    end